    {
      "id": "the-bell-beneath-salt",
      "name": "The Bell Beneath Salt",
      "description": "At low tide, a bell sounds beneath the abandoned saltworks. Cross a drowned quay, breach the lantern gallery, hunt the choir, reunite at the northern landing, and silence two cantors beneath the tower. Five independent expeditions with fresh Heroes and abilities. Blue: player; Red: automated. No unlocks or carryover. Read Objectives in play; both extraction missions require every Hero to survive.",
